://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2022 Q2","e":"ter","d":"2022-07-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Samik Chatterjee","x":"What's the flexibility in terms of taking the cost structure lower or rightsizing it for maybe some of the pushouts in terms of revenue that you're seeing greater -- could you just postponing spend as you're doing announcing today?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2022 Q2","e":"ter","d":"2022-07-27","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Toshiya Hari","x":"And I asked the question because the reasons you noted for, I guess, the reduced outlook for the second half seemed technical transitory.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2022 Q3","e":"ter","d":"2022-10-26","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mark Jagiela","x":"These technology building blocks enable applications to continue to grow in complexity, including emerging applications like AI, ADAS and new compute architectures.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2022 Q4","e":"ter","d":"2023-01-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sanjay Mehta","x":"There are also some price increases baked into our -- that are rolling through in the second half, and some volume that is anticipated in the second half.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2023 Q1","e":"ter","d":"2023-04-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Krish Sankar","x":"So I'm kind of curious, as you get into all these AI stuff, do you think GPU test could grow.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2023 Q2","e":"ter","d":"2023-07-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Greg Smith","x":"Also since April, the accelerating build out of AI enabled cloud computing is driving test demand for compute and networking.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2023 Q2","e":"ter","d":"2023-07-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Greg Smith","x":"And the investments around cloud computing, and especially AI accelerated cloud computing are proceeding at a pretty good clip.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2023 Q2","e":"ter","d":"2023-07-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sanjay Mehta","x":"The third quarter guidance excludes the amortization of acquired intangibles, and restructuring and other charges.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2023 Q3","e":"ter","d":"2023-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sanjay Mehta","x":"Fourth quarter guidance excludes the amortization of acquired intangibles, restructuring and other charges.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2023 Q4","e":"ter","d":"2024-01-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Vivek Arya","x":"And then the growth rate that you’re mentioning, the 1.3% to 1.4%, that seems very modest compared to all the very high growth rates that we see in AI and data center right type products.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2024 Q1","e":"ter","d":"2024-04-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Chin","x":"Just to clarify, maybe firstly, was the third quarter pull-in, was that for AI, for compute, or for memory, or for both?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2024 Q2","e":"ter","d":"2024-07-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Greg Smith","x":"Continuing the trend we noted in the first quarter, Cloud AI demand drove compute revenue with considerable strength in networking devices.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2024 Q2","e":"ter","d":"2024-07-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Greg Smith","x":"AI enabled data centers have a very high number of network connection points to support training large language models, which is changing the mix in this segment to include more networking silicon.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2024 Q3","e":"ter","d":"2024-10-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Greg Smith","x":"We are seeing utilization rates continue to tick higher as test was initially purchased from Mobile increasingly being upgraded to test Cloud AI Compute devices.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2024 Q3","e":"ter","d":"2024-10-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Greg Smith","x":"In Q3, Cloud AI drove Compute Revenue with notable strength in networking devices.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2024 Q4","e":"ter","d":"2025-01-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Greg Smith","x":"In the second half, strength was driven by Cloud AI compute VIP customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2024 Q4","e":"ter","d":"2025-01-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Greg Smith","x":"And we see opportunities in System Level Test for AI Compute.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2024 Q4","e":"ter","d":"2025-01-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Greg Smith","x":"In industrial, one of the things that is actually helping to drive the market there is an indirect pass-through from the AI Compute space.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2024 Q4","e":"ter","d":"2025-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Greg Smith","x":"This restructuring increases our efficiency and reduces our Robotics breakeven revenue from $440 million in 2024 to $365 million in 2025.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2024 Q4","e":"ter","d":"2025-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sanjay Mehta","x":"As Greg mentioned, we are restructuring the Robotics business to create a single point of contact for customers and partners across UR and MiR sales, marketing and service organizations to improve customer experience.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2025 Q1","e":"ter","d":"2025-04-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Greg Smith","x":"Within Semi Test, IST is working hand-in-hand with our SoC team to help current and potential customers in the AI compute space cost-effectively optimized test insertion points.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2025 Q1","e":"ter","d":"2025-04-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Greg Smith","x":"And in product test, our PBT, or production board test, business, which has historically been strongest in the automotive industry, is making gains in AI compute where technologies pioneered by Semi Test are being leveraged to help hyperscalers test server-level products.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2025 Q1","e":"ter","d":"2025-04-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Greg Smith","x":"Although the direct impact of current and anticipated 90-day tariffs on our model is minimal, we are more concerned about the impact of tariffs on the end market demand.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2025 Q1","e":"ter","d":"2025-04-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Sanjay Mehta","x":"Moving to the topic of tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2025 Q1","e":"ter","d":"2025-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sanjay Mehta","x":"Given our restructuring, I'll share the GAAP to non-GAAP reconciliation of the loss.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2025 Q1","e":"ter","d":"2025-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sanjay Mehta","x":"On a GAAP basis, our loss in Q1 was $37 million, including approximately $11 million in restructuring primarily associated with our go-to-market consolidation and $4 million of amortization of intangible assets.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"TER 2025 Q2","e":"ter","d":"2025-07-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Sanjay Mehta","x":"AI compute growth exceeded our plan.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/teradyne-ter-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TER 2025 Q2","e":"ter","d":"2025-07-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Sanjay Mehta","x":"Our multiyear investments in testing artificial intelligence are beginning to deliver new opportunities and accelerating top line growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/teradyne-ter-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TER 2025 Q2","e":"ter","d":"2025-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Gregory Stephen Smith","x":"So with the magnitude of the restructuring, we were really pleased that robotics was able to deliver quarter-on-quarter growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/teradyne-ter-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TER 2025 Q2","e":"ter","d":"2025-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Gregory Stephen Smith","x":"So the thing that I was trying to communicate was that the restructuring was executed successfully and it didn't significantly -- it didn't have a significant negative impact on our results in Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/teradyne-ter-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"TER 2025 Q4","e":"ter","d":"2026-02-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Gregory Smith","x":"This is obvious in compute and memory, however, the rapid build-out of cloud and edge AI is also driving demand for power management, SLT, HDD